{"l":4271,"g":5,"b":5,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'The children were playing in the garden when they found an old coin under a stone.' Hvor fandt børnene mønten?","o":["i en kasse","i sandkassen","under en sten","under et træ"],"a":"under en sten","r":"'Under a stone' betyder under en sten."},
